# Modelfile-r20 — serve the VACA R20 14B student through Ollama.
#
#   ollama create vaca-r20-q4 -f models/Modelfile-r20
#
# Why: the self-play loop (training/selfplay) needs the student on an
# OpenAI-compatible endpoint. dspark (:8000) serves that role but has to be
# started by hand and holds the card while it runs; Ollama is already up on
# 127.0.0.1:11434 and evicts models when VRAM is short, which is what lets the
# Gemma judge and the 14B student share one 12 GB card sequentially across the
# PLAY -> AUDIT stages.
#
# The GGUF carries its own `tokenizer.chat_template`, so no TEMPLATE block is
# needed here — overriding it would only risk diverging from what the model was
# trained with. num_ctx matches backend/llm-config.json's dspark entry (16384).

